      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Lost asks once",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p><strong>Lost</strong> asks once before it counts the drone as lost. Tap <strong>Lost</strong> to confirm, or <strong>Cancel</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/1daf14c11151cfe4.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Take it back",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tapped the wrong ending? <strong>Back to flying</strong> undoes it until you report.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/14e902e7e0b3011a.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Abort",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Back to flying brings the flying card back. Tap Abort there, then pick why or tap <strong>Cancel</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/49fd54e9b68bd8ec.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Back in Requests",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>For 5 seconds, the line under the title says the mission is back in <strong>Requests</strong>. It waits there for your team or another team.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/5f40f0765f11b8eb.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "The asker sees it",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>The asker reads <strong>Aborted, open again</strong> under <strong>Sent</strong> in the <strong>Inbox</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/4fa487b37235c701.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
